{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11206200","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11206200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1120620001:0":{"text":"이곳의 풍경은 정말 아름답네요. 특히 해 질 무렵이 가장 아름다워요. 저희 고향에서는 이런 풍경은 볼 수 없거든요.","source_cn":"这里的风景可真壮美，尤其是落日时分。我们的家乡是见不到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9694B6A7BAEADDB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1120620002:0":{"text":"“헌터 사이렉은 사막의 석양을 바라보며, 마음속에서 충동이 일었다.”","source_cn":"“猎手塞雷克看着荒漠的落日，心里突然涌起了一阵冲动”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1DA01F87B7F3D63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120620003:0":{"text":"“그는 말을 달려, 태양과 황사보다 빠르게 총소리가 울렸던 그 순간으로 돌아가고 싶었다.”","source_cn":"“他要策马奔驰，跑得比骄阳与黄沙更快，重新回到枪声刚刚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DD9DCC27DD8F17A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120620004:0":{"text":"에븐, 약 좀 먹어. 그것도 병이야…","source_cn":"艾文，你又开始了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05AC7792443D5241","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:宝藏猎人欧迪尔":{"text":"오디르","source":"宝藏猎人欧迪尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:宝藏猎人艾文":{"text":"트레져 헌터 에븐","source":"宝藏猎人艾文","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}